'''Baar''' is an [[NPC]] found above the {{Zone|Dragontail Auction House}}. They ask for various gold-themed items in exchange for {{Item|The Alchemist's Staff}} and 250 [[Reputation]].

== Quest ==
The player needs to give '''Baar''' these resources in the following order:
:{{RL|
* 64x Gold Ingot
* 5x Golden Plate
* 1x Diver's Boots
* 1x Diver's Shirt
* 32x Enchanted Gold Block
* 5x Golden Powder
* 32x Enchanted Golden Carrot
* 1x Golden Ball
}}

Which costs roughly {{BZC|*64 Gold Ingot *5 Golden Plate *16 Enchanted Sea Lumies *32 Gill Membrane *32 Enchanted Gold Block *5 Golden Powder *32 Enchanted Golden Carrot *1 Golden Ball}} from the [[Bazaar]], alongside a {{Item|Snorkeling Shoes}} and {{Item|Snorkeling Vest}}. After giving the {{Item|Golden Ball}}, the player will receive {{Item|The Alchemist's Staff}} and 250 [[Reputation]] for their current [[Faction]].

This quest is shared with the {{NPCSprite|Alchemage}}, meaning that any progress contributed to one of the two [[NPC]]s remains on the other.

